# MOVLI Master (project)

## Documentation canon

- Product architecture & protocols: `README.md` (do not duplicate `PROJECT_STATE` version tables here).
- Workspace facts (versions, scripts, CI): `PROJECT_STATE.md`.
- Navigation: `docs/INDEX.md`. Workflow: `docs/CONTRIBUTING.md`. AI ops: `AGENTS.md`.
- End of session: `docs/daily/YYYY-MM-DD.md` (Europe/Kyiv).

## Code

- Contract changes start in `packages/shared`, then server + client.
- Minimal diff; no drive-by refactors.
- Game state: prefer immutability on client; server is authoritative.
- Secrets only in `.env.prod` / `.env.prod.example` — never commit real keys.

## Language

- Ukrainian for project markdown; file names, env vars, Socket.IO events as in code.

## AI

- ECC generic agents: `.cursor/AGENTS.md`.
- Project steward: `@movli-steward` / `.cursor/agents/movli-steward.md`.
- Checklists: `.cursor/skills/movli-master/SKILL.md`.
- Commits/push only on explicit user request; conventional commits `feat|fix|docs|…`.
